  "details": "EAC picks up Dante via as an untrusted program.\nhttps://www.audinate.com/products/software/dante-via \nIf unfamiliar, Dante via is a professional audio routing software used by tens of thousands of professional audio engineers around the world. In reference to VRC this gets used to allow the audio signal to be externally pushed over IP for live event broadcasting, routed between different software, and development/use of ARC on the same computer http://elevativepro.com/arc/\n\n\n\nEdit: I just realized I posted this on the wrong page. I started a new one in app bugs, please dlt this thanks. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/eac-dante-via-false-positive",
